note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Four ordered timestamp reports cover exactly three operations. All-ones is unwritten or refusal.
fn native_gdnbstamp ts view ulong 4 which ulong to ulong
if or gt which 2 eq get ts 3 18446744073709551615
ret 18446744073709551615
end
for i ulong 3
if ge get ts i get ts add i 1
ret 18446744073709551615
end
end
ret sub get ts add which 1 get ts which
end
